<Slide
  style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0B1220', padding: '20px 64px', flexDirection: 'column' }}
  notes={`第二个角色是 DAO，这是 ORM 最反直觉也最爽的一点。

看右边这段代码：@DAO 修饰一个接口，接口继承 RootDAO，里面三个函数都有函数体——findUser 用 DSL 查询，register 用插入并返回自增主键，deleteUser 用模板 SQL 删除。

@DAO 宏展开的结果是「原接口后面跟着一个 extend SqlExecutor 实现了这个接口」。也就是说：没有 DAO 实现类，SqlExecutor 本身就是实现，接口里写的函数体就是方法实现。

为什么能做到？因为 SqlExecutor 是所有 DAO 的公共载体，宏把接口的方法挂到它身上。所以约束是这么来的：

第一，DAO 必须声明为接口，而且所有函数都要有默认实现——没有实现类，函数体不写就没人写了。

第二，建议 public 修饰、不要泛型形参、继承 RootDAO。

第三，一个持久化对象对应一个 DAO 接口。

第四，同一模块内所有 DAO 的函数名最好不要重名——因为它们都挂在同一个 SqlExecutor 上。这一条很容易踩，两个 DAO 都写 findById 就冲突了。

理解了这四条，DAO 就没有坑了。`}
>
  <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 40, background: '#38BDF8' }} />
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>第 12 章 · ORM f_orm · 12.1 续</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>三个角色之二：DAO 就是接口</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>没有 DAO 实现类</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#0B1220', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #38BDF8', padding: 18, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', marginBottom: 8 }}>fdemo/user/src/dao/UserDAO.cj</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#38BDF8', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>@DAO</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"public interface UserDAO <: RootDAO {"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    func findUser(id: Int64): UserPO {"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#38BDF8', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"        executor.FROM<UserPO>().WHERE(UserPO.tableColumns().id.eq(id))"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#38BDF8', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"                .first<UserPO>().getOrThrow()"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    }"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    func register(username: String, password: String): Int64 {"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"        let user = UserPO()"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"        user.username = username"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"        user.password = password"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#F59E0B', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"        executor.INSERT_INTO<UserPO>(user)   // 返回自增主键"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    }"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    func deleteUser(id: Int64): Int64 {"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#F59E0B', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"        executor.setSql('delete from user_info where id = ${arg(id)}').delete"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"    }"}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.7, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{"}"}</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
      <Box style={{ height: 116, background: '#111C2E', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #38BDF8', padding: 18, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#38BDF8' }}>@DAO 展开成什么</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8 }}>原接口 + extend SqlExecutor 实现该接口。所以没有 DAO 实现类，SqlExecutor 本身就是实现。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#111C2E', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #1E293B', padding: 18, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0' }}>四条约束（都来自上面那句话）</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 10 }}>1　DAO 必须声明为接口，且所有函数都要有默认实现</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 6 }}>2　建议 public、不要泛型形参、继承 RootDAO</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 6 }}>3　一个持久化对象对应一个 DAO 接口</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#F59E0B', lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 6 }}>4　同一模块内所有 DAO 的函数名最好不要重名 —— 它们都挂在同一个 SqlExecutor 上</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 'auto' }}>两个 DAO 都写 findById 就会冲突，这是最容易踩的一条。</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', borderTop: '1px solid #1E293B' }}>
